<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Synetic Inc reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Synetic Inc reinstated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday it had reinstated coverage of Synetic Inc with a rating of near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Elmwood Park, N.J., plastic components maker closed on Monday at 48-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
